{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-0e587446-7ee3-45fd-91a4-d42db6542a6b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Claude-Opus-4.8","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019Z8S6m88AswWRSYyVaboKm","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--flashinfer--gqa_paged_decode_h32_kv8_d128_ps1/docs/plan.md","old_string":"## 7. Immediate next action (next turn)\nImplement **c001** exactly per §2, run the §3 self-audit, then evaluate with\n`./scripts/evaluate_candidate.sh feedback c001` and append its record to `candidates.jsonl`.\nNo candidate is implemented or evaluated in this (planning) turn.","new_string":"## 7. Progress log\n\n- **c001 — KEPT.** Single-pass GQA-grouped baseline, 5/5 pass, geomean **633.20x**\n  (W1 416x, W2 1425x, W3 99x, W4 1345x, W5 1285x). Correctness confirmed including\n  base-2 LSE, tail mask, and empty guard. Bottlenecks that bound the geomean:\n  - **W3** (batch=1, 65 tokens): only 99x. Grid = (1, 8) = 8 CTAs on 108 SMs →\n    severely under-occupied + launch/latency-bound.\n  - **W1** (batch=16, ~1307 tok/seq): 416x, sol=227µs vs ~43µs HBM floor. Grid =\n    (16, 8) = 128 CTAs, each long-running over ~1307 tokens → poor latency hiding /\n    load imbalance across variable sequence lengths.\n  Both point to the same fix: **split the KV axis (flash-decoding / split-K)** to\n  raise CTA count and bound per-CTA work.\n\n### Next action\nImplement **c002** per §2 (split-K / flash-decoding, two-pass with combine, S==1\nfast-path, host-side `num_splits` heuristic from `kv_indptr` diffs). Parent = c001.\nSingle structural change; evaluate once and compare geomean, watching W3/W1/W5."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bd820bf-e535-4fc9-bdad-5891d1907993","uuid":"732d5c87-9eef-4244-9